{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>As far as the site of Shechem, as far as Elon Moreh.</b> He showed him the receiving of the Torah and the oath at Mount Gerizim and Mount Ebal. He showed him the receiving of the Torah to indicate that in the merit of receiving the Torah he merited the promise 'לְזַרְעֲךָ אֶתֵּן אֶת הָאָרֶץ' (Genesis 12:7), as it is written (Psalms 105:44-45) 'וַיִּתֵּן לָהֶם אַרְצוֹת גּוֹיִם וַעֲמַל לְאֻמִּים יִירָשׁוּ בַּעֲבוּר יִשְׁמְרוּ חֻקָּיו וְתוֹרֹתָיו יִנְצֹרוּ'. And corresponding to what He said above, 'וּמְקַלֶּלְךָ אָאֹר' (Genesis 12:3), He indicated that this would be 'as far as Elon Moreh' and not absolutely — for all the blessings and the curses at Mount Gerizim and Mount Ebal would be with the agreement of HaShem, blessed be He, and He would not curse those cursers, for their curse is for the sake of the ultimate purpose and is reckoned as a blessing."], :book :genesis, :voice :kli-yakar, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:27:59.888914459Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}